 me I don't hate anyone I pray  for the president all the time so don't  mess with me when it comes to words why  that on Twitter the president quickly  accused Pelosi of having a quote nervous  fit she fired back last night the  president is a master at projecting wait  call somebody else nervous he's the  nervous one one potentially explosive  variable coming on Monday is the Justice  Department internal watchdogs highly  anticipated report into how the FBI  handled the Trump campaign investigation  into whether the campaign had ties to  Russia during the 2016 election that  could create a whole new firestorm Gail  all right so much more to come thank you  very much Nancy
 

